OL,3,GNEWSAWill Oxford's Botley Road reopen
OL,4,Ato traffic this month?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree years, five months and nine days.
OL,7,FThat is how long Oxford's Botley Road
OL,8,Fwill have been closed when it is due to
OL,9,Freopen on 20 September.
OL,11,FThe main route into the city centre has
OL,12,Fbeen shut to traffic since April 2023
OL,13,Ffor Network Rail's work to upgrade
OL,14,FOxford railway station.
OL,16,FMultiple reopening dates have come and
OL,17,Fgone, with the latest postponement
OL,18,Fannounced in July after gas leaks were
OL,19,Fdiscovered during excavation work.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
